compare_all_result.description:
Every contract in the same family as yours (fixed or variable, spot-indexed, or time-of-use) available in your region, priced against your own settings. Your own contract carries a YOUR CONTRACT badge; every other row ends with the difference against it, a minus being money saved.

{ranking}

Estimates, not quotes. Each row prices a full year of your measured volumes against a single published tariff card, so it says what a year at those prices would cost rather than what you will be billed. Nothing is saved; submit to close.
